    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benyamini alikuwa na wana watano: Bela, mzaliwa wake wa kwanza, Ashbeli wa pili, Ahara wa tatu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noha wa nne na Rafa wa tano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bela naye alikuwa na wana: Adari, Gera, Abihudi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishua, Naamani, Ahoa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gera, Shufamu na Huramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hawa ndio wazawa wa Ehudi. Hawa walikuwa viongozi wa jamaa za wale waliokuwa wakiishi Geba, lakini wakachukuliwa mateka uhamishoni Manahathi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naamani, Ahiya na Gera. Gera, baba yake Uza na Ahihudi, ndiye aliyewaongoza kuchukua hatua hiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaharaimu aliwapa talaka wake zake wawili, Hushimu na Baara na baadaye alipata watoto wa kiume nchini Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwoa Hodeshi, naye akamzalia wana saba: Yoabu, Sibia, Mesha, Malkamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeuzi, Sakia, na Mirma. Hawa wanawe wote walikuja kuwa wakuu wa koo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaharaimu na mkewe Hushimu alipata wana wengine wawili: Abitubu na Elpaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Elpaali walikuwa watatu: Eberi, Mishamu na Shemedi ambaye aliijenga miji ya Ono na Lodi, pamoja na vijiji kandokando yake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beria na Shema walikuwa miongoni mwa jamaa ambazo zilikuwa zinaishi katika mji wa Aiyaloni, na kuwafukuza wenyeji wa Gathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Ahio, Shashaki, Yeremothi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zebadia, Aradi, Ederi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikaeli, Ishpa na Yoha ni wazawa wengine wa Beria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zebadia, Meshulamu, Hizki, Heberi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishnerai, Izlia na Yobabu walikuwa wazawa wa Epaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakimu, Zikri, Zabdi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elienai, Zilethai, Elieli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adaya, Beraya na Shimrathi walikuwa wazawa wa Shimei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishpani, Eberi, Elieli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abdoni, Zikri, Hanani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanania, Elamu, Anthothiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifdeya na Penueli walikuwa wazawa wa Shashaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shamsherai, Sheharia, Athalia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaareshia, Elia na Zikri walikuwa baadhi ya wazawa wa Yerohamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hao ndio waliokuwa wakuu wa koo zao kulingana na vizazi vyao. Walikuwa wakuu na waliishi Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeieli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:29",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yeieli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Linganisha 9:35, Kiebrania hakina jina hili.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " alikuwa mwanzilishi wa mji wa Gibeoni. Mkewe alikuwa Maaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzaliwa wake wa kwanza alikuwa Abdoni. Wanawe wengine ni Zuri, Kishi, Baali, Nadabu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedori, Ahio, Zekeri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Miklothi baba yake Shimea. Hawa pia waliishi Yerusalemu karibu na watu wengine wa ukoo wao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neri alimzaa Kishi, Kishi akamzaa Shauli. Shauli alikuwa na wana wanne: Yonathani, Malki-shua, Abinadabu na Eshbaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathani alimzaa Merib-baali, na Merib-baali akamzaa Mika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mika alikuwa na wana wanne: Pithoni, Meleki, Terea na Ahazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi alimzaa Yehoada. Naye Yehoada aliwazaa Alemethi, Azmawethi na Zimri. Zimri alimzaa Mosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosa alimzaa Binea, aliyemzaa Rafa, aliyemzaa Eleasa, naye Eleasa akamzaa Aseli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Aseli walikuwa sita: Majina yao ni Azrikamu, Bokeru, Ishmaeli, Shearia, Obadia na Hanani. Wote hawa walikuwa wana wa Aseli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wana wa Esheki, nduguye Aseli, walikuwa watatu. Mzaliwa wake wa kwanza alikuwa Ulamu, wa pili Yeushi na wa tatu Elifeleti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Ulamu walikuwa watu mashujaa sana wa vita, na wapiga upinde hodari. Alikuwa na wana na wajukuu wengi, jumla150. Hao wote waliotajwa hapo juu walikuwa wa ukoo wa Benyamini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
